          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jul 26 2024 15:31:53 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Experience our powered gear in action at EMS World 2027</span></span></h3>\n<h3>Interactive demos</h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Ready to get hands-on with products like <b>the new Mini-PRO,&nbsp;</b><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/emergency-care/products/power-pro-2.html\">Power-PRO 2</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/emergency-care/products/lifepak-35.html\">LIFEPAK 35</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/emergency-care/products/lucas-3.html\">LUCAS</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/emergency-care/products/xpedition-powered-stair-chair.html\">Xpedition</a>? Join us for a demo where you can experience the future of EMS for yourself and chat with experts about the ways we can support your mission.&nbsp;</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 06 2026 15:20:50 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
